reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Qu'en est-il de l'amélioration de tes capacités cardio-respiratoires ? Tu devrais vraiment être très à l'aise à ton allure de footing arrivé(e) à ce stade de ta préparation ! Lorsqu'on est en forme, les footings, ce sont des entraînements où on a presque l'impression d'être aussi frais en revenant qu'avant d'être parti ! (et si tu es parti déjà fatigué(e) à cause de l'entraînement fractionné de la veille par exemple... alors tu ne devrais pas être plus fatigué(e) encore en rentrant sinon mieux vaut raccourcir le footing avant de rentrer dans cet état d'accumulation de fatigue supplémentaire!)","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1788739200000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.017543859649122,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EnduForce_600_4","description":"Séance d'endurance de force en **deux blocs identiques**. Il y a **3 intervalles de 30\"** par bloc, chacun suivi par 3' de repos courues très lentement et/ou marchées. À la fin du premier bloc, après le dernier sprint de 30', prends les 5' *(soit 2' de bonus !)* puis recommence une seconde fois ce même bloc.","displayName":"Endurance de Force","coachAdvice":"L'avantage de ces hautes vitesses, c'est qu'elles te permettent d'ouvrir ta foulée. Ca te donne la possibilité de développer ta technique et ton efficacité. Donc malgré la difficulté liée à cette intensité maximale, reste relâché(e), avec une belle posture, avec une bonne réactivité du pied au sol.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_20","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":20,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":3,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"ENDU_FORCE_30","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Rapide","value":192,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"fast"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recuppassive_3","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":597,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":180,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_2","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":597,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":2,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":3,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"ENDU_FORCE_30","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Rapide","value":192,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"fast"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recuppassive_3","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":597,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":180,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"CD_10","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":10,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"cool-down"}],"difficulty":4,"trainingIndex":5,"weekDate":1788739200000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":8.210708145993124,"expectedDuration":3180},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1200,"pace":{"value":327}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":30,"pace":{"value":192}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":180,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":30,"pace":{"value":192}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":180,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":30,"pace":{"value":192}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":180,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":120,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":30,"pace":{"value":192}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":180,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":30,"pace":{"value":192}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":180,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":30,"pace":{"value":192}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":180,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":600,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"SL_75_HARD_2","description":"Sortie longue en endurance fondamentale avec un bloc actif **FACULTATIF** en deuxième moitié de sortie (en cas de fatigue excessive, douleur, manque d'envie...). Le bloc actif de 25' en continu est composé d'une pyramide : 5' d'endurance active, 5' Tempo, 5' sweetspot puis on redescend, 5' Tempo, 5' d'endurance active.","displayName":"Sortie Longue & Active","coachAdvice":"Une autre \"petite\" sortie longue de 1h15. On sait que ça parait peu pour certains... Le fait est qu'en dehors d'une prépa spécifique semi ou marathon, pas besoin d'en faire beaucoup plus, on se concentre sur les entraînements du coeur de la semaine !","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"SL","trainingCategory":"road_long_run","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_40","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zone